#: ../developer/web-app.md:1
msgid "The owner web app"
msgstr "面向所有者的 Web 应用"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:3
msgid ""
"The rules each owner-facing feature follows, the endpoints behind it, and"
" what only a browser can check. User documentation belongs to each "
"distribution; the app's Help link opens it (**Admin → Settings → "
"General**, `site.docs_url`, seeded from `AGENT_WEB_DOCS_URL`)."
msgstr ""
"面向所有者的各项功能遵循的规则、背后的端点，以及只有在浏览器里才能检查的内容。用户文档由各发行版自己提供；应用的帮助链接会打开它（**Admin "
"→ Settings → General**，`site.docs_url`，初始值来自 `AGENT_WEB_DOCS_URL`）。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:8
msgid "Sidebar and conversation list"
msgstr "侧边栏和对话列表"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:10
msgid ""
"The sidebar keeps its layout per signed-in user in the current browser: "
"grouping (by project or one list), ordering (last updated or manual), "
"expanded projects, manual positions and added workspaces. Pinned "
"conversations share one manual order across both groupings and appear "
"once, outside the project folders. Conversations without a repository go "
"in a **Start from scratch** folder."
msgstr ""
"侧边栏按已登录用户在当前浏览器中保存布局：分组方式（按项目或单一列表）、排序方式（最近更新或手动）、展开的项目、手动排列的位置和添加的工作区。置顶对话在两种分组下共用一个手动顺序，只在项目文件夹之外出现一次。没有仓库的对话放在"
" **Start from scratch** 文件夹中。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:17
msgid ""
"Search (Command+K on a Mac, Ctrl+K elsewhere) matches titles and full "
"repository names across the whole history; a result opens the "
"conversation's latest turn. A completed turn shows an unread dot until it"
" is opened. Read receipts are saved to the account, and open tabs sync "
"them on focus, on reconnection and every 30 seconds while visible."
msgstr ""
"搜索（Mac 上 Command+K，其他系统 "
"Ctrl+K）在全部历史中匹配标题和完整仓库名；点击结果会打开该对话的最新一轮。已完成的轮次在被打开前显示未读圆点。已读记录保存在账号中，打开的标签页会在获得焦点、重新连接时以及可见期间每"
" 30 秒同步一次。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:23
msgid "Creating a repository"
msgstr "创建仓库"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:25
msgid ""
"**Create repository**, in the repository pickers, creates a repository "
"with a README (so it has a default branch) in the user's personal GitHub "
"account, never an organization's. It needs the GitHub App's **Repository "
"creation: write** or **Administration: Read and write** permission "
"([Credentials](operations.md#2-credentials)). The App does not gain "
"access to the new repository, and repository-access checks still apply."
msgstr ""
"仓库选择器中的 **Create repository** 会在用户的个人 GitHub 账号下创建一个带 README "
"的仓库（因此有默认分支），从不在组织下创建。它需要 GitHub App 的 **Repository creation: write** 或 "
"**Administration: Read and write** "
"权限（[Credentials](operations.md#2-credentials)）。App "
"不会因此获得新仓库的访问权，仓库访问检查照常适用。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:32
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "新手引导"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:34
msgid ""
"An account with no conversations, archived ones included, sees a "
"**Getting started** row: **Connect a model**, **Connect GitHub**, **Grant"
" a repository** and **Run your first task**, with state from `/config`. "
"The model step appears while `model_connections_enabled` is true and is "
"done once `model_connection_required` is false. The GitHub steps are left"
" out while the deployment has no usable GitHub App, and the row is hidden"
" when nothing is left to offer. The sidebar, the new-task page and the "
"conversation explanations share one first-run check, `GET "
"/v1/agent/conversations?include_archived=true&limit=2`. **Skip** hides "
"the row for that account in that browser; the settings page brings it "
"back."
msgstr ""
"没有任何对话（包括已归档的）的账号会看到 **Getting started** 一行：**Connect a model**、**Connect"
" GitHub**、**Grant a repository** 和 **Run your first task**，状态来自 "
"`/config`。`model_connections_enabled` 为 true "
"时显示模型这一步，`model_connection_required` 变为 false 即算完成。部署没有可用的 GitHub App 时省略"
" GitHub 相关步骤，没有可做的步骤时整行隐藏。侧边栏、新建任务页面和对话说明共用一个首次使用检查：`GET "
"/v1/agent/conversations?include_archived=true&limit=2`。**Skip** "
"会在该浏览器中为该账号隐藏这一行；设置页面可以把它找回来。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:45
msgid "Conversations API"
msgstr "对话列表 API"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:47
msgid ""
"`GET /v1/agent/conversations` returns `conversations` and `next_cursor`. "
"Each row carries the latest `job`, the canonical `title`, `archived` and "
"`last_activity_at`."
msgstr ""
"`GET /v1/agent/conversations` 返回 `conversations` 和 `next_cursor`。每一行带着最新的"
" `job`、规范的 `title`、`archived` 和 `last_activity_at`。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../developer/web-app.md
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../developer/web-app.md
msgid "`q`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/web-app.md
msgid ""
"Case-insensitive literal substring of the title or full repository name, "
"at most 200 characters; `%` and `_` match themselves"
msgstr "标题或完整仓库名中不区分大小写的字面子串，最多 200 个字符；`%` 和 `_` 只匹配自身"

#: ../developer/web-app.md
msgid "`repo`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/web-app.md
msgid "Exact repository"
msgstr "精确匹配仓库"

#: ../developer/web-app.md
msgid "`temporary`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/web-app.md
msgid "`true` lists only conversations without a repository; not with `repo`"
msgstr "为 `true` 时只列出没有仓库的对话；不能与 `repo` 同用"

#: ../developer/web-app.md
msgid "`include_archived`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/web-app.md
msgid "Include archived conversations; defaults to false"
msgstr "包含已归档的对话；默认为 false"

#: ../developer/web-app.md
msgid "`pinned`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/web-app.md
msgid "`true` or `false` for only pinned or only unpinned rows; omitted, both"
msgstr "`true` 或 `false` 分别只列出置顶或未置顶的行；省略时两者都列出"

#: ../developer/web-app.md
msgid "`limit`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/web-app.md
msgid "Page size, 1–200; defaults to 50"
msgstr "每页条数，1–200；默认 50"

#: ../developer/web-app.md
msgid "`cursor`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/web-app.md
msgid ""
"Opaque cursor from the previous response, scoped to the owner and the "
"filters"
msgstr "上一次响应给出的不透明游标，限定在当前所有者和这组过滤条件内"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:61
msgid ""
"Rows are ordered by pin time, then activity, then thread id. Conversation"
" and message updates and job transitions count as activity; lease "
"heartbeats do not. Because a conversation can move ahead of an older "
"cursor, clients reload from the first page when activity changes. `/jobs`"
" keeps its own semantics."
msgstr ""
"行依次按置顶时间、活动时间、thread id "
"排序。对话和消息的更新以及任务状态变化算作活动；租约心跳不算。对话可能移到较早游标的前面，所以活动变化时客户端从第一页重新加载。`/jobs` "
"保持自己的语义。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:66
msgid ""
"Sources: "
"[`AgentsSidebar.tsx`](../../apps/frontend/src/components/features/agents/sidebar/AgentsSidebar.tsx),"
" "
"[`sidebarPreferences.ts`](../../apps/frontend/src/components/features/agents/sidebar/sidebarPreferences.ts),"
" [`catalog.py`](../../apps/backend/cloud_agent/api/catalog.py) and "
"[`conversation_queries.py`](../../apps/backend/cloud_agent/storage/repositories/conversation_queries.py)."
msgstr ""
"源码：[`AgentsSidebar.tsx`](../../apps/frontend/src/components/features/agents/sidebar/AgentsSidebar.tsx)、[`sidebarPreferences.ts`](../../apps/frontend/src/components/features/agents/sidebar/sidebarPreferences.ts)、[`catalog.py`](../../apps/backend/cloud_agent/api/catalog.py)"
" 和 "
"[`conversation_queries.py`](../../apps/backend/cloud_agent/storage/repositories/conversation_queries.py)。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:71
msgid "Conversation view"
msgstr "对话视图"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:73
msgid "The turn rail"
msgstr "轮次导航条"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:75
msgid ""
"The rail sits in the Chat column's right gutter when the conversation has"
" at least two visible turns, the column is at least 720px wide, the "
"reading area at least 200px high, and the pointer is fine; Trajectory has"
" none. The current turn has the longest, darkest mark. Mark length shows "
"interaction state only, never message length, duration or tokens. The "
"rail scrolls on its own in long conversations."
msgstr ""
"当对话至少有两个可见轮次、栏宽至少 720px、阅读区高度至少 200px，且指针为精确指针时，轮次导轨出现在 Chat "
"栏右侧的边距中；Trajectory 视图没有导轨。当前轮次的标记最长、颜色最深。标记长度只表示交互状态，从不表示消息长度、耗时或 token "
"数。在很长的对话中，导轨自己滚动。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:82
msgid ""
"A mark's preview shows the question as sent and, once the turn has ended,"
" the attempt's last visible reply, capped at 50 and 120 characters, "
"without reasoning or tool output. Clicking a mark puts the turn's first "
"question about 24px below the top of the reading area, without changing "
"the URL, the selected attempt or the workspace. Hovering and jumping send"
" no request. The rail is a named navigation region of buttons with one "
"mark in the tab order; arrow keys, Home and End reach the others, and the"
" current mark has `aria-current`."
msgstr ""
"标记的预览显示发送时的问题，轮次结束后再显示该 attempt 最后一条可见回复，分别截断到 50 和 120 "
"个字符，不含推理或工具输出。点击标记会把该轮的第一个问题放在阅读区顶部下方约 24px 处，不改变 URL、所选 attempt "
"或工作区。悬停和跳转都不发送请求。导轨是一个带名称的导航区域，由按钮组成，只有一个标记在 Tab 顺序中；方向键、Home 和 End "
"可以到达其他标记，当前标记带有 `aria-current`。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:91
msgid "Reading position"
msgstr "阅读位置"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:93
msgid ""
"The transcript either follows new output or holds the reader's text in "
"place. It opens following, and follows again after **Back to bottom**, a "
"scroll to the live end, or a follow-up the reader sent. Scrolling up, "
"jumping through the rail or selecting an older attempt holds the "
"position; new content then marks **Back to bottom** without pulling the "
"reader back. Switching to Trajectory and back keeps the position, and "
"reloading opens at the end."
msgstr ""
"对话记录要么跟随新输出，要么把读者正在看的文字固定在原处。打开时处于跟随状态；点 **Back to "
"bottom**、滚动到实时末尾，或读者发送了后续消息后，会重新跟随。向上滚动、通过导轨跳转或选择较早的 attempt "
"会固定位置；这时新内容只会在 **Back to bottom** 上做标记，不会把读者拉回去。切换到 Trajectory "
"再切回来位置不变，重新加载则打开在末尾。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:100
msgid "Tasks and subagents"
msgstr "任务和子代理"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:102
msgid ""
"The **Tasks and subagents** window shows the selected turn and attempt's "
"latest task list and delegated agents, when either has recorded data. A "
"subagent's reply, under **Returned to the main agent**, comes from:"
msgstr ""
"**Tasks and subagents** 窗口显示所选轮次和 attempt 最新的任务列表和委派的 "
"agent（两者之一有记录数据时才显示）。子 agent 的回复显示在 **Returned to the main agent** "
"下，来源如下："

#: ../developer/web-app.md:106
msgid ""
"Claude Code's Agent or Task, and OpenCode's and Kilo's task: the call's "
"own result (Claude also records the agent's status);"
msgstr ""
"Claude Code 的 Agent 或 Task，以及 OpenCode 和 Kilo 的 task：调用本身的结果（Claude 还会记录该"
" agent 的状态）；"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:108
msgid "Codex: the message of the agent state its `wait` call reports;"
msgstr "Codex：其 `wait` 调用报告的 agent 状态中的消息；"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:109
msgid "pi: nothing, since it has no subagents."
msgstr "pi：无，因为它没有子 agent。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:111
msgid ""
"A tool from an MCP server is never shown as a task list or subagent, "
"whatever its name. Trajectory links a child step to its delegating step "
"through runtime ownership records: Claude Code records the delegating "
"call, and Codex the subagent's thread."
msgstr ""
"来自 MCP 服务器的工具，不管叫什么名字，都不会显示为任务列表或子 agent。Trajectory "
"通过运行时的归属记录把子步骤链接到委派它的步骤：Claude Code 记录委派调用，Codex 记录子 agent 的线程。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:116
msgid "Turn screenshots and sandbox incidents"
msgstr "轮次截图和沙箱事件"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:118
msgid ""
"After a turn settles, the transcript shows up to six of the latest raster"
" images written under the workspace artifacts directory between "
"`startedAt` minus 2 seconds and `finishedAt` plus 5 seconds. The listing "
"is cached per conversation for 20 seconds, and a cold or deleted sandbox "
"shows nothing. A `lifecycle` event with phase `sandbox_incident` "
"(`out_of_memory`, `container_exited`, `mcp_server_failed`) shows as a "
"one-line notice without limits or exit codes."
msgstr ""
"轮次结束后，对话记录最多显示六张最新的位图图片，它们是在 `startedAt` 减 2 秒到 `finishedAt` 加 5 秒之间写入工作区"
" artifacts 目录的。图片列表按对话缓存 20 秒，冷沙箱或已删除的沙箱不显示任何内容。阶段为 `sandbox_incident` 的 "
"`lifecycle` "
"事件（`out_of_memory`、`container_exited`、`mcp_server_failed`）显示为一行提示，不包含限制值或退出码。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:126
msgid ""
"Sources: "
"[`TurnScreenshots.tsx`](../../apps/frontend/src/components/features/agents/conversation/TurnScreenshots.tsx)"
" and "
"[`sandboxIncidentNotice.ts`](../../apps/frontend/src/components/features/agents/adapt/sandboxIncidentNotice.ts)."
msgstr ""
"源码：[`TurnScreenshots.tsx`](../../apps/frontend/src/components/features/agents/conversation/TurnScreenshots.tsx)"
" 和 "
"[`sandboxIncidentNotice.ts`](../../apps/frontend/src/components/features/agents/adapt/sandboxIncidentNotice.ts)。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:129
msgid "Workspace pane keyboard"
msgstr "工作区面板的键盘操作"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:131
msgid ""
"In the workspace, Git, file and terminal tab strips, Left/Right, Home and"
" End select a view. A narrow Git pane picks the changed file from a "
"selector so the diff keeps the full width. Opening a file in a narrow "
"pane focuses its preview, and **Back** or Escape returns to that file in "
"the list."
msgstr ""
"在工作区、Git、文件和终端的标签栏中，左右方向键、Home 和 End 用于切换视图。窄的 Git 面板用下拉选择器选择已更改的文件，让 "
"diff 保持全宽。在窄面板中打开文件会把焦点移到预览，**Back** 或 Escape 返回列表并定位到该文件。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:136
msgid "Checking it in a browser"
msgstr "在浏览器里检查"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:138
msgid ""
"Unit and DOM tests (`useConversationScroll.dom.test.tsx`) cover the "
"navigation data, focus and an injected box model. Reflow, the sticky "
"composer, resize timing and real pixel positions need a browser and a "
"conversation with several turns:"
msgstr ""
"单元测试和 DOM "
"测试（`useConversationScroll.dom.test.tsx`）覆盖导航数据、焦点和注入的盒模型。重排、吸附的输入框、尺寸变化的时机和真实像素位置，则需要浏览器和一个有多轮的对话："

#: ../developer/web-app.md:143
msgid ""
"Click a middle mark: its question lands about 24px below the top and the "
"mark becomes current."
msgstr "点击中间的一个标记：它的问题落在顶部下方约 24px 处，该标记变为当前标记。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:145
msgid "Scroll well into a long turn: its mark stays current."
msgstr "在一个很长的轮次中向下滚动足够远：它的标记仍是当前标记。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:146
msgid ""
"Scroll up while output streams: the text holds its position within a few "
"pixels and **Back to bottom** appears."
msgstr "在输出流式到达时向上滚动：文字的位置偏差在几个像素以内，并出现 **Back to bottom**。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:148
msgid "Use **Back to bottom** or scroll to the end: following resumes."
msgstr "使用 **Back to bottom** 或滚动到末尾：恢复跟随。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:149
msgid ""
"Try columns on both sides of 720px, reading areas on both sides of 200px,"
" and touch input."
msgstr "分别试试宽于和窄于 720px 的栏、高于和低于 200px 的阅读区，以及触摸输入。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:151
msgid ""
"Expand a tool row, resize the composer, and toggle the workspace while "
"reading history: the text stays in place."
msgstr "阅读历史时展开工具行、调整输入框大小、开关工作区：文字保持不动。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:153
msgid ""
"With about 100 turns, check mark spacing, rail scrolling and keyboard "
"access."
msgstr "在约 100 轮的对话中，检查标记间距、导轨滚动和键盘访问。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:155
msgid "Fork a conversation: the copied turns have marks and previews."
msgstr "Fork 一个对话：复制过来的轮次有标记和预览。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:156
msgid "Switch to Trajectory and back: no rail there, and Chat keeps its position."
msgstr "切到 Trajectory 再切回来：那里没有导航条，Chat 保持原来的位置。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:157
msgid ""
"Repeat the keyboard checks in both languages and themes, and with reduced"
" motion."
msgstr "在两种语言、两种主题以及减少动态效果的设置下重复键盘检查。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:160
msgid ""
"Design: [turn navigation](../agents/specs/2026-09-11-conversation-turn-"
"navigation-design.zh.md). Sources: "
"[`JobDetail.tsx`](../../apps/frontend/src/components/features/agents/JobDetail.tsx),"
" "
"[`TurnNavigator.tsx`](../../apps/frontend/src/components/features/agents/conversation/TurnNavigator.tsx),"
" "
"[`conversationTurnNavigation.ts`](../../apps/frontend/src/components/features/agents/conversation/conversationTurnNavigation.ts)"
" and "
"[`useConversationScroll.ts`](../../apps/frontend/src/components/features/agents/conversation/useConversationScroll.ts)."
msgstr ""
"设计：[轮次导航](../agents/specs/2026-09-11-conversation-turn-navigation-"
"design.zh.md)。源码：[`JobDetail.tsx`](../../apps/frontend/src/components/features/agents/JobDetail.tsx)、[`TurnNavigator.tsx`](../../apps/frontend/src/components/features/agents/conversation/TurnNavigator.tsx)、[`conversationTurnNavigation.ts`](../../apps/frontend/src/components/features/agents/conversation/conversationTurnNavigation.ts)"
" 和 "
"[`useConversationScroll.ts`](../../apps/frontend/src/components/features/agents/conversation/useConversationScroll.ts)。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:166
msgid "Models and the composer picker"
msgstr "模型页面和输入框选择器"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:168
msgid ""
"**Settings → Models** (`/settings/models`) manages the models an owner's "
"tasks run on. Deployment-provided models come first, by name; the owner's"
" personal connections fold beneath them and open for a link with "
"`#settings-connections`. In the composer, provided models and then the "
"owner's enabled connections form one flat list. An owner's own connection"
" overrides a provided model of the same name. A follow-up keeps its "
"parent's model and connection together, and marks the selection "
"unavailable rather than switch to another source with the same model "
"name."
msgstr ""
"**Settings → "
"Models**（`/settings/models`）管理所有者的任务可以使用的模型。部署提供的模型排在前面，按名称排列；所有者的个人连接折叠在下方，通过带"
" `#settings-connections` "
"的链接打开时会展开。在输入框中，部署提供的模型在前、所有者已启用的连接在后，组成一个平铺列表。所有者自己的连接会覆盖同名的部署提供模型。后续消息保持其上一轮的模型和连接组合；不可用时标记为不可用，而不会换成另一个同名模型的来源。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:177
msgid ""
"Sources: "
"[`ModelsSettingsView.tsx`](../../apps/frontend/src/components/features/settings/ModelsSettingsView.tsx),"
" "
"[`ProvidedModelsCard.tsx`](../../apps/frontend/src/components/features/settings/ProvidedModelsCard.tsx),"
" "
"[`providedModels.ts`](../../apps/frontend/src/components/features/agents/composer/providedModels.ts)"
" and "
"[`modelSource.ts`](../../apps/frontend/src/components/features/agents/composer/modelSource.ts)."
msgstr ""
"源码：[`ModelsSettingsView.tsx`](../../apps/frontend/src/components/features/settings/ModelsSettingsView.tsx)、[`ProvidedModelsCard.tsx`](../../apps/frontend/src/components/features/settings/ProvidedModelsCard.tsx)、[`providedModels.ts`](../../apps/frontend/src/components/features/agents/composer/providedModels.ts)"
" 和 "
"[`modelSource.ts`](../../apps/frontend/src/components/features/agents/composer/modelSource.ts)。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:182
msgid "Tool approvals"
msgstr "工具审批"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:184
msgid ""
"The **Approvals** inbox lists pending MCP calls across the owner's "
"conversations. **Approve** releases that one held request under its "
"current authorization and attempt fence, and **Deny** refuses it; neither"
" changes a conversation's permission rules. An expired call leaves the "
"queue, and a decision that loses a race with expiry or another tab cannot"
" revive it."
msgstr ""
"**Approvals** 收件箱列出所有者各个对话中待处理的 MCP 调用。**Approve** 在当前授权和 attempt "
"栅栏下放行这一个被挂起的请求，**Deny** "
"拒绝它；两者都不会改变对话的权限规则。过期的调用会离开队列；与过期或另一个标签页竞争失败的决定不能让它复活。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:190
msgid ""
"**Always allow**, in a conversation's tools panel, records the approval "
"and the permission in one server-side transaction. The rule is saved once"
" no call on that connection waits for approval or dispatch, and covers "
"only that capability in that conversation. Before saving, the server "
"checks the owner, connection and policy revisions and the capability "
"fingerprint again, and discards the request if any changed, so a revoked "
"permission is never restored."
msgstr ""
"对话工具面板中的 **Always allow** "
"会在一个服务端事务中同时记录这次批准和以后的权限。等该连接上没有调用在等待批准或分发时，规则才会保存，而且只覆盖该对话中的这一项能力。保存前，服务器会再次检查所有者、连接和策略的版本以及能力指纹，任何一项有变化就丢弃这次请求，因此已撤销的权限绝不会被恢复。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:198
msgid ""
"A held call waits up to ten minutes. Claude Code's per-server request and"
" idle timeouts match its 26-minute tool timeout, so its network timers "
"cannot abandon a call Approvals still shows as pending. A client that "
"accepts SSE gets keepalives during the wait, then the single JSON-RPC "
"result. Disconnecting cancels the wait and expires the approval, which is"
" then never dispatched. An error after dispatch can leave the outcome "
"unknown."
msgstr ""
"被挂起的调用最多等待十分钟。Claude Code 每个服务器的请求超时和空闲超时都设为与其 26 分钟的工具超时一致，这样它的网络计时器不会放弃"
" Approvals 中仍显示为待处理的调用。接受 SSE 的客户端在等待期间收到保活消息，最后收到唯一的 JSON-RPC "
"结果。断开连接会取消等待并使批准过期，过期的批准永远不会被分发。分发之后出错时，结果可能未知。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:205
msgid ""
"`GET /v1/agent/mcp/invocations?pending_only=true` reads the owner's "
"pending inbox; `job_id` or `thread_id` narrows it, and a history read "
"requires one of them. `limit` is 1 to 100 (default 50). Page with "
"`next_before_id` as `before_id` while `has_more` is true. Reading never "
"changes an invocation or grants a permission. The relay side is in [MCP "
"servers](operations.md#authorization-and-routing)."
msgstr ""
"`GET /v1/agent/mcp/invocations?pending_only=true` 读取所有者的待处理收件箱；`job_id` 或"
" `thread_id` 用于缩小范围，读取历史时必须带其中之一。`limit` 取 1 到 100（默认 50）。`has_more` 为 "
"true 时，把 `next_before_id` 作为 `before_id` 翻页。读取从不改变调用记录，也不授予权限。中继一侧见 [MCP "
"servers](operations.md#authorization-and-routing)。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:212
msgid "Memory, avatars and home suggestions"
msgstr "记忆、头像和首页建议"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:214
msgid ""
"Memory holds the lasting rules agents follow for an owner "
"([design](../agents/specs/2026-10-13-memory-redesign.zh-CN.md)). Avatars "
"and home suggestions are worked out from recent requests on each read; "
"they are not stored, not given to agents, and not affected by memory "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"记忆保存 agent 为某个所有者长期遵守的规则（[设计](../agents/specs/2026-10-13-memory-redesign"
".zh-CN.md)）。头像和首页建议在每次读取时根据最近的请求推算；它们不保存、不提供给 agent，也不受记忆设置影响。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:219
msgid "Memory"
msgstr "记忆"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:221
msgid ""
"A memory is one English sentence in one of two scopes: user memory "
"applies to every project, and project memory to one repository, where it "
"takes precedence. Agents call `memory_save`, `memory_update` and "
"`memory_delete` on the platform's MCP endpoint, saving to the task's "
"repository unless told the rule applies everywhere. Updating or deleting "
"archives the old memory. Each write checks that the task's attempt is "
"still the running one."
msgstr ""
"一条记忆是一句英文，属于两种范围之一：用户记忆适用于所有项目，项目记忆适用于一个仓库，并在该仓库中优先。Agent 通过平台 MCP 端点调用 "
"`memory_save`、`memory_update` 和 "
"`memory_delete`，默认保存到任务所在的仓库，除非被告知这条规则适用于所有项目。更新或删除会把旧记忆归档。每次写入都会检查任务的 "
"attempt 是否仍是正在运行的那个。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:228
msgid ""
"When a task starts, the control plane adds the repository's and the "
"user's active memories ahead of the request, up to 12,000 characters, "
"repository memories and the most recently edited first. Each scope has "
"its own switch. A scope holds up to 30 active memories of at most 240 "
"characters. When it is full, the least recently used agent-saved memory "
"is archived; owner-written or edited ones never are, so a scope full of "
"them refuses a new one. Archived memories can be restored for 90 days."
msgstr ""
"任务开始时，控制平面把仓库和用户的有效记忆放在请求前面，最多 12,000 "
"个字符，仓库记忆和最近编辑的排在前面。每个范围有自己的开关。一个范围最多有 30 条有效记忆，每条最多 240 个字符。范围满了时，最久未使用的 "
"agent 保存的记忆会被归档；所有者写入或编辑过的记忆从不会这样被归档，所以全是这类记忆的范围会拒绝新记忆。已归档的记忆在 90 天内可以恢复。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md
msgid "Request"
msgstr "请求"

#: ../developer/web-app.md
msgid "What it does"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../developer/web-app.md
msgid "`GET /v1/agent/memories`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/web-app.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The user memories, as `{repo, enabled, memories, archived}`; "
"`?repo=owner/repository` for one repository's"
msgstr ""
"用户记忆，格式为 `{repo, enabled, memories, archived}`；加 `?repo=owner/repository`"
" 则返回某个仓库的记忆"

#: ../developer/web-app.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`POST /v1/agent/memories` with `{content, repo}`"
msgstr "`POST /v1/agent/memories`，请求体 `{content, repo}`"

#: ../developer/web-app.md
msgid "Adds an owner-written memory; `repo` is `null` for every project"
msgstr "添加一条所有者写的记忆；适用于所有项目时 `repo` 为 `null`"

#: ../developer/web-app.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`PATCH /v1/agent/memories/{id}` with `{content, repo, expected_version}`"
msgstr "`PATCH /v1/agent/memories/{id}`，请求体 `{content, repo, expected_version}`"

#: ../developer/web-app.md
msgid "Rewrites or moves a memory"
msgstr "改写或移动一条记忆"

#: ../developer/web-app.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`DELETE /v1/agent/memories/{id}` with `{expected_version}`"
msgstr "`DELETE /v1/agent/memories/{id}`，请求体 `{expected_version}`"

#: ../developer/web-app.md
msgid "Deletes a memory"
msgstr "删除一条记忆"

#: ../developer/web-app.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`POST /v1/agent/memories/{id}/restore` with `{expected_version}`"
msgstr "`POST /v1/agent/memories/{id}/restore`，请求体 `{expected_version}`"

#: ../developer/web-app.md
msgid "Restores an archived memory"
msgstr "恢复一条已归档的记忆"

#: ../developer/web-app.md
msgid "`DELETE /v1/agent/memories`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/web-app.md
msgid "Clears one scope, archive included"
msgstr "清空一个范围，包括已归档的记忆"

#: ../developer/web-app.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`PUT /v1/agent/memories/settings` with `{repo, enabled}`"
msgstr "`PUT /v1/agent/memories/settings`，请求体 `{repo, enabled}`"

#: ../developer/web-app.md
msgid "Turns a scope on or off"
msgstr "打开或关闭一个范围"

#: ../developer/web-app.md
msgid "`GET /v1/agent/memories/projects`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/web-app.md
msgid "The repositories the owner worked in or keeps memories for"
msgstr "所有者工作过或保存有记忆的仓库"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:247
msgid ""
"Refusals: `memory_changed` (409, stale version), `memory_scope_full` "
"(409), `memory_invalid` (422: credentials, over 240 characters, or "
"limited to the current task) and `memory_not_found` (404). No response "
"echoes memory text."
msgstr ""
"拒绝原因：`memory_changed`（409，版本已过时）、`memory_scope_full`（409）、`memory_invalid`（422：含凭据、超过"
" 240 个字符，或只适用于当前任务）和 `memory_not_found`（404）。任何响应都不会回显记忆文本。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:251
msgid "Avatars and home suggestions"
msgstr "头像和首页建议"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:253
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Without a profile photo, an account is shown as one of seven generated "
"Pokémon companions, fixed for the account (`companion_data_url` from `GET"
" /v1/agent/profile`). On the homepage, its habitat and badges follow the "
"work areas that English keywords reveal in the owner's latest 50 "
"requests, and up to three suggestions point out change requests without "
"success checks, failure reports without reproduction steps, and reviews "
"without a stated scope. Only the owner's own text counts. `GET "
"/v1/agent/insights` returns `{focus_areas, suggestions, avatar}`. "
"Everything is drawn locally as SVG; no identifier or request text is "
"embedded, and no image service or model is used."
msgstr ""
"没有头像照片的账号显示为七只生成的宝可梦伙伴之一，每个账号固定一只（`GET /v1/agent/profile` 返回的 "
"`companion_data_url`）。在首页上，它的栖息地和徽章跟随所有者最近 50 "
"条请求中英文关键词反映出的工作领域；最多三条建议会指出没有成功判据的修改请求、没有复现步骤的故障报告，以及没有说明范围的审查请求。只统计所有者自己写的文字。`GET"
" /v1/agent/insights` 返回 `{focus_areas, suggestions, avatar}`。所有图形都在本地以 "
"SVG 绘制；不嵌入任何标识或请求文本，也不使用图片服务或模型。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:264
msgid "Workspace files"
msgstr "工作区文件"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:266
msgid ""
"The **Files** pane shows the retained sandbox's repository, read-only. "
"Paths stay inside the repository: absolute paths, parent traversal and "
"`.git` are refused, and symlinks are not followed. A long folder listing "
"says what it left out. Copy and download offer only complete files within"
" the preview limit; raster images get a preview, and HTML and SVG show as"
" escaped text. In a conversation without a repository, **Download "
"workspace** saves the workspace as one `.tar.gz` without `.git` and "
"metadata files, and refuses a workspace over the server's limit "
"([Temporary workspaces](operations.md#temporary-workspaces))."
msgstr ""
"**Files** 面板以只读方式显示保留沙箱中的仓库。路径不能超出仓库：绝对路径、向上遍历和 `.git` "
"都会被拒绝，符号链接不会被跟随。很长的目录列表会说明省略了哪些内容。复制和下载只提供不超过预览上限的完整文件；位图图片有预览，HTML 和 SVG"
" 显示为转义后的文本。在没有仓库的对话中，**Download workspace** 把工作区保存为一个 `.tar.gz`，不含 `.git`"
" 和元数据文件，超过服务器上限的工作区会被拒绝（[Temporary workspaces](operations.md#temporary-"
"workspaces)）。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:276
msgid "Smaller features"
msgstr "其他小功能"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:278
msgid ""
"**Notifications** (**My Settings → Notifications**): browser "
"notifications for agent questions and finished turns, per account, while "
"the app is open."
msgstr ""
"**Notifications**（**My Settings → Notifications**）：应用打开期间，针对 agent "
"提问和已完成轮次的浏览器通知，按账号设置。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:280
msgid ""
"**Plugins** (**+ → Plugins**, before a chat's first task, up to eight): "
"Claude Code and Codex take `name@marketplace` from a GitHub repository or"
" public HTTPS marketplace; pi, OpenCode and Kilo take npm package names, "
"optionally pinned (`@example/plugin@1.2.3`). A failed installation stops "
"startup, and Fork inherits the selection."
msgstr ""
"**Plugins**（**+ → Plugins**，在对话的第一个任务之前选择，最多八个）：Claude Code 和 Codex 接受来自 "
"GitHub 仓库或公开 HTTPS marketplace 的 `name@marketplace`；pi、OpenCode 和 Kilo 接受"
" npm 包名，可固定版本（`@example/plugin@1.2.3`）。安装失败会中止启动，Fork 会继承所选插件。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:285
msgid ""
"**Review**: an independent code-review subagent in a workspace tab, "
"covering every change since the conversation's original base, told not to"
" edit files. It needs a native Fork, so it cannot start from an archived "
"chat or one whose context was lost."
msgstr ""
"**Review**：在工作区标签页中启动一个独立的代码审查子 agent，审查对话原始基线以来的所有改动，并要求它不要编辑文件。它需要原生 "
"Fork，所以不能从已归档的对话或上下文已丢失的对话启动。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:289
msgid ""
"**Watch PR and merge**: a follow-up in which the agent watches checks and"
" reviews, pushes fixes to the pull request's branch, and merges once the "
"head meets the required checks and reviews. It ends with the turn's "
"timeout."
msgstr ""
"**Watch PR and merge**：一条后续消息，agent "
"在其中关注检查和审查结果，把修复推送到拉取请求的分支，并在最新提交满足必需的检查和审查后合并。它随轮次超时结束。"

#: ../developer/web-app.md:293
msgid ""
"Watch PR and merge works as the owner through the GitHub relay, with git "
"and `gh api` REST calls, so the owner needs a GitHub account that may "
"push to the repository. The relay refuses GraphQL, so the agent asks the "
"owner to mark a draft ready, and never merges a draft."
msgstr ""
"Watch PR and merge 以所有者的身份通过 GitHub 中继工作，使用 git 和 `gh api` REST "
"调用，所以所有者需要一个有权推送到该仓库的 GitHub 账号。中继拒绝 GraphQL，因此 agent "
"会请所有者把草稿标记为就绪，并且从不合并草稿。"

